# Per-role ACL for the Mosquitto broker.
# Three accounts: bridge (mqtt-bridge service), z2m (Zigbee2MQTT), nodes (ESP32 fleet).
#
# nodes shares one account across all ESP32s — per-device accounts would require
# firmware reconfiguration for each new device; deferred to a future firmware release.

user bridge
# bridge reads all lumi frames (LWT, state_report, discovery) and all z2m topics
topic readwrite lumi/#
topic read zigbee2mqtt/#

user z2m
# Zigbee2MQTT publishes and subscribes only under its own base topic
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#

user nodes
# ESP32 nodes publish availability/state/discovery and subscribe to commands
topic readwrite lumi/#
